  "structure": "CSharp platform memory primitives select Windows process heap, Linux malloc/free or browser allocation. Raw primitives return null; expression allocation adds the guard. SLG currently calls CRT allocation directly across runtime and container producers. Migrate every allocator-family consumer together; keep native API-specific releases such as LocalFree/freeaddrinfo unchanged.",
